note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note src/physics0/planner/pd0_planner_types.om: the PD-0 planner's structs (C pd0_planner.h). An OM-2 struct
note is declared before the program's first fn, so every planner build puts this unit first.
note Pd0pBounds: describe bounds (PD0DESC2 reset box per variable). Pd0pDomain: visited range per observed
note variable. Pd0pHyps: 2..8 hypotheses as vr_ relation slots, slot[0] the best candidate, and the pooled
note residual sd on SELECT (micro, > 0). Pd0pProposal: status, D, info proxy, cost, counters, the behaviour-5
note flag, the seed, exp_slot, the ve_ slot that holds the PD0EXP1 (schedule, trajectories, D, hash), and prior,
note the prior set the proposal is checked against (0: none, the C NULL prior; 1: the planner's prior set).
struct Pd0pBounds n_obs uchar n_channels uchar chan_min long 4 chan_max long 4 reset_min long 8 reset_max long 8 episode_max_steps uint end
struct Pd0pDomain var_min long 8 var_max long 8 end
struct Pd0pHyps n_hyp uchar slot ulong 8 residual_sd_micro long end
struct Pd0pProposal status int divergence_micro long info_proxy_micro long cost_micro long n_candidates uint n_refined uint n_skipped_duplicate uint outside_middle uchar seed ulong exp_slot ulong prior ulong end
